# issue: none
# notes: 64 indexed docs on a line; eligibility n>3 makes d004,d005,d006 exact nearest winners from 2.3. This bounded one-partition setting case does not reproduce custom-centroid or multi-partition ANN probe-budget experiments.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 60000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Doc { slug: String @key n: I64 @index embedding: Vector(4) @index }

